# Vinebred Brawler: "This creature must be blocked if able." (CR 509.1c) Bot1 attacks with Vinebred Brawler and Elvish Mystic into Bot2's lone
# Ornithopter. Declaring no blockers is refused, and so is blocking the Mystic: the one creature able to block must block the Brawler. "Whenever
# this creature attacks, another target Elf you control gets +2/+1 until end of turn": the Mystic is the only other Elf, a 3/2 for the turn. The
# Brawler (4/2) kills the Ornithopter (0/2); the Mystic hits for 3 (CR 510.1).

